WEBVTT

01:30.970 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.050 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 7]

01:38.340 --> 01:40.860
[Taiyufeng]

01:57.720 --> 01:59.759
From now on, call him Mr. Gu.

02:00.430 --> 02:01.650
Mr. Gu.

02:01.810 --> 02:03.760
He's sent here by our boss.

02:04.310 --> 02:04.920
Mr. Gu.

02:05.350 --> 02:07.480
Have you worked in a pawnshop before?

02:08.240 --> 02:08.750
No.

02:09.350 --> 02:09.830
No?

02:10.840 --> 02:11.640
He's a genius.

02:14.520 --> 02:16.240
Since the beginning of time,

02:16.280 --> 02:18.540
our shop has finally welcomed new rules.

02:18.680 --> 02:20.590
You all came at the right time.

02:21.420 --> 02:22.870
From now on, Mr. Gu

02:23.000 --> 02:24.910
will be our...

02:29.079 --> 02:30.010
Fourth Manager.

02:30.900 --> 02:31.829
Fourth Manager.

02:33.000 --> 02:34.470
Strange things happen every year,

02:34.470 --> 02:36.400
but this year, it's more abundant.

02:37.610 --> 02:40.380
Make some room for the Fourth Manager.

02:47.079 --> 02:49.079
Fourth Manager, please move aside.

02:52.380 --> 02:53.640
Please move a bit more.

03:03.520 --> 03:04.980
Fourth Manager, make way.

03:09.510 --> 03:10.400
Fourth Manager,

03:10.400 --> 03:11.460
please step aside.

03:48.470 --> 03:50.470
You have to deliver gifts yourself?

03:50.960 --> 03:52.690
He's just a county magistrate.

03:53.150 --> 03:54.480
If this were in Beijing,

03:54.680 --> 03:55.750
even if those officials with red hats

03:55.750 --> 03:56.680
came to my house,

03:57.000 --> 03:58.470
they wouldn't get to see my father

03:58.470 --> 04:00.400
if he didn't feel like seeing them.

04:00.400 --> 04:01.730
You're the young master,

04:01.730 --> 04:02.240
and I'm naturally

04:02.240 --> 04:03.590
just an errand boy.

04:03.870 --> 04:05.180
After meeting the magistrate,

04:05.180 --> 04:06.120
I'll know

04:06.150 --> 04:07.750
how to survive in this place.

04:12.400 --> 04:14.150
You've seen the silver mountain over there

04:14.150 --> 04:15.400
that vexes all the thieves, right?

04:15.400 --> 04:16.600
I really like it.

04:16.890 --> 04:18.120
I plan to put one

04:18.140 --> 04:19.269
in front of our shop too.

04:19.269 --> 04:19.930
Right here,

04:20.310 --> 04:20.910
I'll erect

04:21.000 --> 04:23.130
a huge silver gourd over 3 meters tall.

04:23.830 --> 04:25.630
The feng shui master told me that

04:25.830 --> 04:28.750
the area near the city gate
has the strongest fortune.

04:28.750 --> 04:29.560
I plan to

04:29.560 --> 04:31.020
absorb it all completely.

04:31.270 --> 04:32.800
And those buildings over there.

04:32.800 --> 04:33.800
I'll rent them too

04:34.159 --> 04:35.690
to set up a large draft bank.

04:36.040 --> 04:38.159
One for deposits, one for withdrawals.

04:38.159 --> 04:39.880
What's so great about the Eight Families?

04:39.880 --> 04:41.190
Besides their draft banks,

04:41.190 --> 04:42.250
they have nothing.

04:42.430 --> 04:43.760
My father even said that

04:44.000 --> 04:45.240
the Li family will go all out

04:45.240 --> 04:46.570
to make a big impression here.

04:46.570 --> 04:49.230
I think it's making a mountain
out of a molehill.

04:50.390 --> 04:51.250
Three years...

04:52.560 --> 04:53.260
No, in 3 months,

04:53.260 --> 04:54.000
and the crowd to our shops

04:54.000 --> 04:56.200
will reach the Eight Families' houses.

04:59.270 --> 05:00.510
What are you laughing at?

05:00.510 --> 05:02.170
I'm smiling at your ambition.

05:06.510 --> 05:08.140
Do you not believe in me,

05:08.270 --> 05:09.730
or do you lack confidence?

05:12.320 --> 05:13.380
Pingyao isn't big,

05:14.060 --> 05:14.680
but this is

05:14.680 --> 05:16.850
the financial center of the Qing Empire.

05:16.850 --> 05:17.950
Your father said

05:18.000 --> 05:19.120
to go all out.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.510
But I think even with all your efforts,

05:21.510 --> 05:23.840
you may not be able
to shake things up here.

05:23.950 --> 05:25.920
The Eight Families of Shanxi have been
around for over 200 years.

05:25.920 --> 05:26.820
They have their own history.

05:26.820 --> 05:28.420
I'll tell you about it later.

05:59.630 --> 06:01.340
Since you've already run away,

06:01.340 --> 06:02.670
why bother coming back?

06:03.840 --> 06:04.440
Mr. Chang.

06:04.480 --> 06:05.750
You're awake just in time.

06:05.750 --> 06:07.010
The porridge is ready.

06:07.160 --> 06:07.600
Look.

06:08.070 --> 06:10.070
I borrowed a portable stove for you.

06:24.120 --> 06:25.450
Some chestnuts for you.

06:30.390 --> 06:31.910
And some shredded chicken.

06:31.910 --> 06:34.110
This is best for restoring your energy.

06:34.130 --> 06:35.210
I didn't make this.

06:35.280 --> 06:36.360
Ms. Chang made it.

06:39.270 --> 06:39.750
Here.

06:40.390 --> 06:41.070
Try some.

06:42.490 --> 06:43.550
Careful, it's hot.

06:52.870 --> 06:53.530
Delicious.

06:58.000 --> 06:59.860
Where did this cabinet come from?

07:00.880 --> 07:02.480
From the government office.

07:03.160 --> 07:04.260
Surprising, isn't it?

07:04.260 --> 07:05.310
You must be the first person

07:05.310 --> 07:07.770
in history to be imprisoned
in such comfort.

07:13.530 --> 07:15.060
What did you trade for this?

07:15.750 --> 07:16.480
Myself.

07:18.750 --> 07:20.050
What do you mean?

07:21.680 --> 07:22.480
Wang Tiangui

07:22.660 --> 07:24.000
gave me 30 days

07:24.630 --> 07:26.030
to sort out his pawnshop.

07:26.980 --> 07:28.360
I've also become the first person

07:28.360 --> 07:30.750
in history to be the fourth manager
in a pawnshop.

07:30.750 --> 07:31.950
But for these 30 days,

07:32.110 --> 07:33.630
you'll have to bear
with the inconvenience.

07:33.630 --> 07:34.720
Thirty days?

07:35.659 --> 07:36.440
That pawnshop

07:36.440 --> 07:37.830
has Wang Tiangui helpless
over its management

07:37.830 --> 07:38.970
for 30 years.

07:39.240 --> 07:41.500
How could you possibly
sort it out in 30 days?

07:41.500 --> 07:42.960
That's fooling yourself.

07:43.430 --> 07:44.600
It's only the first day.

07:44.600 --> 07:45.430
There's still time.

07:45.430 --> 07:46.090
I can learn.

07:47.240 --> 07:49.010
Those old appraisers in the pawnshop

07:49.010 --> 07:51.040
were trained by Wang Tiangui's father

07:51.040 --> 07:52.100
when he was around.

07:52.430 --> 07:54.430
They won't be easy to get along with.

07:54.600 --> 07:55.240
Even

07:55.270 --> 07:56.530
lifelong businessmen

07:56.540 --> 07:58.480
would be helpless in there.

07:59.000 --> 07:59.600
Mr. Gu,

08:00.070 --> 08:01.240
this is a profession

08:01.630 --> 08:03.270
you must not take lightly.

08:04.880 --> 08:06.810
I wouldn't dare underestimate it.

08:06.830 --> 08:08.090
But as the saying goes,

08:08.240 --> 08:10.000
"Different trades
share the same principles."

08:10.000 --> 08:12.050
People's hearts are the same everywhere.

08:12.050 --> 08:12.920
Their pawnshop

08:12.950 --> 08:14.950
just has a slightly higher counter.

08:15.430 --> 08:16.790
Even if it's a hard nut to crack,

08:16.790 --> 08:17.870
I'll break it open.

08:42.919 --> 08:45.200
Please take a look at this, Manager.

09:02.790 --> 09:03.960
My eyes are blurry.

09:04.350 --> 09:05.950
I can't see clearly anymore.

09:06.630 --> 09:07.600
Sir,

09:08.870 --> 09:09.550
what are you

09:09.600 --> 09:11.200
trying to pawn here?

09:12.150 --> 09:13.720
This is our family heirloom,

09:13.720 --> 09:15.310
a jade from the Shang and Zhou dynasties.

09:15.310 --> 09:17.840
My elderly mother is ill
and wants to pawn it.

09:19.280 --> 09:20.790
A family heirloom jade?

09:21.770 --> 09:24.350
Was your home underground?

09:25.150 --> 09:27.380
Why does it smell so strongly of soil?

09:28.480 --> 09:29.200
What?

09:29.590 --> 09:30.630
Does your pawnshop

09:30.630 --> 09:32.490
care about where items come from?

09:32.660 --> 09:35.320
You really think
you're the government office?

09:35.840 --> 09:36.870
I wouldn't dare.

09:38.190 --> 09:40.870
Catching thieves is not our business.

09:41.360 --> 09:41.990
However,

09:42.790 --> 09:45.320
if there's a major case
at the government office,

09:45.320 --> 09:47.530
they'll definitely come to our pawnshop

09:47.530 --> 09:48.510
to investigate.

09:49.630 --> 09:50.270
Sir.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.840
According to the
"Great Qing Legal Code,"

09:52.840 --> 09:55.870
grave robbery is punishable by death.

09:58.550 --> 09:59.150
You have

09:59.670 --> 10:00.550
good eyes.

10:01.480 --> 10:02.340
This jade piece

10:02.550 --> 10:03.750
was acquired by
my grandfather's generation

10:03.750 --> 10:04.670
back then.

10:04.850 --> 10:06.550
If I were to sell this in the capital,

10:06.550 --> 10:08.910
it would fetch at least
several thousand taels of silver.

10:08.910 --> 10:11.730
I'm only asking for 500 taels
from your pawnshop.

10:14.950 --> 10:16.570
500 taels isn't much.

10:17.790 --> 10:19.000
But there's one problem.

10:19.000 --> 10:21.540
You claim it's from the Shang-Zhou period.

10:24.000 --> 10:24.560
Hey-

10:25.360 --> 10:26.690
This was made this year!

10:28.200 --> 10:29.800
You carved the jade,

10:29.840 --> 10:31.300
heated it until red-hot,

10:31.480 --> 10:32.550
and then threw it

10:32.600 --> 10:34.630
into the abdomens of living cats and dogs.

10:34.630 --> 10:36.030
You used their vital essence

10:36.030 --> 10:37.360
to age it artificially.

10:37.700 --> 10:38.440
Young man,

10:39.080 --> 10:40.150
what you're doing

10:40.200 --> 10:42.000
will bring bad karma.

10:42.030 --> 10:43.490
You're talking nonsense!

10:44.480 --> 10:45.680
Seek a third opinion.

10:46.000 --> 10:48.050
If anyone says this is genuine,

10:48.150 --> 10:49.870
you can pluck out these old eyes of mine

10:49.870 --> 10:51.750
and step on them till they pop.

10:53.480 --> 10:54.670
Go away.

10:54.790 --> 10:56.480
I've smashed this jade for you

10:57.080 --> 10:59.910
to prevent you from cheating others.

11:02.410 --> 11:03.080
Mr. Zhu,

11:03.390 --> 11:05.250
if it weren't for your expertise,

11:05.320 --> 11:07.380
I would have been completely fooled.

11:11.390 --> 11:12.150
Gu Chaofeng.

11:12.790 --> 11:14.450
You're late on your first day.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.600
Are your eyes on top of your head?

11:19.600 --> 11:20.540
Why are you putting on airs

11:20.540 --> 11:21.550
and pretending to be a big shot?

11:21.550 --> 11:22.750
You're an appraiser,

11:22.840 --> 11:23.630
and so am I.

11:24.060 --> 11:25.480
Why speak so harshly?

11:29.670 --> 11:30.960
Well, of course.

11:31.240 --> 11:32.340
This guy

11:32.410 --> 11:34.440
has never worked a day
in a pawnshop before.

11:34.440 --> 11:36.360
But he has the boss to rely on.

11:36.870 --> 11:38.680
Of course, he doesn't see us as equals.

11:38.680 --> 11:39.440
If there's anything

11:39.440 --> 11:41.330
I, the Fourth Manager, can help with,

11:41.330 --> 11:42.300
just let me know.

11:54.910 --> 11:55.510
Young man,

11:55.870 --> 11:56.670
let me ask you.

11:57.630 --> 11:58.630
What does the fourth manager

11:58.630 --> 11:59.960
usually handle at work?

12:04.590 --> 12:05.040
I see.

12:06.330 --> 12:07.360
I'd like to see

12:07.390 --> 12:08.690
your previous years' ledgers.

12:08.690 --> 12:10.020
Where might I find them?

12:16.600 --> 12:17.660
The ledgers aren't here.

12:17.660 --> 12:18.720
They're upstairs.

12:22.240 --> 12:22.790
Manager!

12:23.510 --> 12:24.910
Pawn these for me!

12:32.660 --> 12:34.660
Give me 500 taels of silver for them!

12:35.360 --> 12:38.020
This blade was given to me by the Marshal.

12:38.440 --> 12:39.630
This Imperial Yellow Jacket

12:39.630 --> 12:41.630
was bestowed upon me
by the Emperor himself.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.570
I risked my life

12:42.760 --> 12:43.550
to earn

12:43.550 --> 12:44.790
these two items.

12:44.910 --> 12:46.080
I want 500 taels for them,

12:46.080 --> 12:47.280
not a candareen less!

12:47.630 --> 12:49.030
These two items together

12:49.050 --> 12:50.550
aren't worth even 5 taels of silver.

12:50.550 --> 12:51.630
Our shop can't accept them.

12:51.630 --> 12:52.120
Perhaps

12:52.140 --> 12:53.740
you should try another pawnshop.

12:53.740 --> 12:54.670
What did you say?

12:54.870 --> 12:56.070
Five taels of silver?

12:56.480 --> 12:58.270
Are you looking down on the Emperor,

12:58.270 --> 12:59.510
the Marshal,

12:59.910 --> 13:00.870
or me?

13:01.040 --> 13:01.770
No, no.

13:02.120 --> 13:02.670
Give it!

13:02.700 --> 13:03.700
Give it back to me!

13:03.720 --> 13:04.550
Don't!

13:04.670 --> 13:05.770
I'll cut you in half!

13:05.770 --> 13:06.960
This is my precious blade!

13:06.960 --> 13:07.390
Fourth Manager.

13:07.390 --> 13:08.150
-Fourth Manager!
-Give it to me!

13:08.150 --> 13:09.080
Fourth Manager!

13:09.240 --> 13:10.300
Your time to shine!

13:10.750 --> 13:11.480
Hand it over!

13:19.210 --> 13:20.210
You, look at them.

13:20.710 --> 13:21.940
Take a good look!

13:38.510 --> 13:40.370
You said you work for the Marshal.

13:40.370 --> 13:41.900
May I ask what rank you hold?

13:42.320 --> 13:43.480
My surname is Bao.

13:43.960 --> 13:46.080
I'm here in Shanxi
to collect military funds.

13:46.080 --> 13:47.430
By the Emperor's grace,

13:47.790 --> 13:49.790
I hold a second-rank military position.

13:49.790 --> 13:50.550
What?

13:51.030 --> 13:53.120
Do you want to see my red official's hat?

13:53.120 --> 13:54.320
I've heard that under the Marshal,

13:54.320 --> 13:55.750
there are two formidable commanders,

13:55.750 --> 13:57.000
Sir Bao and Sir Ta.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.270
Could you be

13:59.360 --> 14:00.960
Sir Bao Qingde?

14:03.600 --> 14:04.860
I've long admired you.

14:06.480 --> 14:07.820
Taqibu has passed away.

14:08.550 --> 14:10.050
Currently, military funding
across the country

14:10.050 --> 14:11.080
is not coming in promptly.

14:11.080 --> 14:12.340
The soldiers in my camp

14:12.720 --> 14:14.560
haven't been paid for half a year.

14:14.560 --> 14:15.360
I had no choice

14:15.360 --> 14:16.290
but to pawn this,

14:16.630 --> 14:18.360
so my brothers in the Bao Regiment

14:18.360 --> 14:19.820
can have something to eat.

14:20.440 --> 14:21.640
If I've offended you,

14:22.030 --> 14:23.090
please forgive me.

14:23.790 --> 14:25.520
Only a true hero can be himself.

14:26.000 --> 14:28.610
Sir Bao, how much would you
like to pawn this for?

14:28.610 --> 14:29.080
Just...

14:29.390 --> 14:30.480
Just 500 taels of silver would be enough.

14:30.480 --> 14:31.600
Just 500 taels isn't enough,

14:31.600 --> 14:32.530
it's too little.

14:33.040 --> 14:34.240
Staff, make a record.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.450
One precious blade,

14:36.510 --> 14:38.310
and one Imperial Yellow Jacket,

14:38.440 --> 14:40.300
pawned for 1,000 taels of silver.

14:40.960 --> 14:41.470
This...

14:49.600 --> 14:51.520
Announce the pawn and write the receipt,

14:51.520 --> 14:52.960
that's the rule.

14:54.080 --> 14:55.610
What's there to fuss about?

14:57.600 --> 14:58.320
Write it.

15:09.680 --> 15:10.550
Sir Bao.

15:11.360 --> 15:13.080
These are all banknotes
from the Four Major Banks,

15:13.080 --> 15:15.140
accepted everywhere in the country.

15:18.720 --> 15:19.360
Thank you.

15:24.080 --> 15:24.960
Gu Pingyuan.

15:25.200 --> 15:26.000
You...

15:26.020 --> 15:27.390
Who do you think you are?

15:28.200 --> 15:30.380
He asked for 500, and you gave him 1,000.

15:30.380 --> 15:31.720
You don't care about losses, do you?

15:31.720 --> 15:33.450
This was your job to begin with,

15:33.870 --> 15:34.930
you told me to do it.

15:35.200 --> 15:35.720
You...

15:38.630 --> 15:39.960
Someone come down here!

15:43.980 --> 15:44.720
Quickly,

15:45.000 --> 15:46.840
lock him up in a room somewhere

15:46.870 --> 15:47.750
so he can cool down.

15:47.750 --> 15:49.610
I think he's not right in the head.

15:52.260 --> 15:53.860
You just watched him do that?

16:18.760 --> 16:24.300
[Taiyufeng General Ledger]

16:36.540 --> 16:37.430
[Seventh of the month;
A set of porcelain vases, 10 taels]

16:37.460 --> 16:38.510
[Eighth of the month;
2 bolts of embroidery, 25 taels]

16:38.530 --> 16:39.580
[Ninth of the month;
a set of red jade calculations, 15 taels]

17:00.630 --> 17:03.230
You let him announce the pawn
at the counter.

17:03.260 --> 17:04.849
You couldn't make a decision yourself,

17:04.849 --> 17:06.680
so you let an amateur decide for you.

17:06.680 --> 17:08.480
You've really become senile!

17:09.550 --> 17:10.400
Exactly.

17:10.819 --> 17:12.589
You've set a precedent by letting him

17:12.589 --> 17:13.950
announce a pawn today.

17:14.030 --> 17:17.490
You won't be able to stop him
from doing anything in the future.

17:17.680 --> 17:18.980
I think the 3 of us

17:19.400 --> 17:20.960
should pack our bedrolls

17:20.980 --> 17:22.240
and leave while we can.

17:22.550 --> 17:23.349
Head manager,

17:23.670 --> 17:25.880
we've been following you for decades.

17:26.510 --> 17:27.510
Whatever you say,

17:27.550 --> 17:28.690
we'll do.

17:29.680 --> 17:32.270
But about resigning from this job,

17:32.750 --> 17:34.140
is it a real resignation

17:34.270 --> 17:36.200
or a strategic retreat?

17:36.750 --> 17:38.140
Please let us know.

17:41.810 --> 17:43.610
We have to nip trouble in the bud.

17:43.960 --> 17:45.580
This decision isn't mine to make,

17:45.580 --> 17:46.550
it's the boss's.

17:50.760 --> 17:52.220
Notify all employees that

17:52.350 --> 17:54.280
the pawnshop won't open tomorrow.

17:54.590 --> 17:56.320
No business will be conducted.

17:56.510 --> 17:57.710
We're shutting down.

18:12.030 --> 18:12.830
Jin, right?

18:13.830 --> 18:14.880
Here, take it.

18:16.590 --> 18:17.200
You know,

18:17.510 --> 18:19.160
you've been locked up here all day,

18:19.160 --> 18:20.830
and nobody's brought you anything to eat.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.400
Well,

18:21.790 --> 18:23.000
my wife made lunch.

18:23.160 --> 18:23.920
I couldn't finish it,

18:23.920 --> 18:25.320
so I brought some for you.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.240
That's great.

18:26.240 --> 18:27.100
Thank you, Jin.

18:27.720 --> 18:28.720
Don't mention it.

18:29.480 --> 18:30.260
I've been

18:30.640 --> 18:31.680
idle all day

18:32.030 --> 18:33.290
and I can't eat a thing.

18:33.440 --> 18:34.830
Why have you been idle all day?

18:34.830 --> 18:35.690
What happened?

18:38.640 --> 18:39.510
The head manager

18:39.510 --> 18:41.110
told us to put up the shutters

18:41.160 --> 18:42.200
and stop doing business.

18:42.200 --> 18:43.260
We're closed down.

18:43.270 --> 18:45.270
He and the second and third managers

18:45.400 --> 18:46.860
went to the boss to resign.

18:47.160 --> 18:48.560
Did they resign for good?

18:50.920 --> 18:52.960
How would people like me know about that?

18:52.960 --> 18:53.710
Anyway,

18:53.960 --> 18:55.200
in this pawnshop,

18:56.000 --> 18:57.480
the three appraiser masters always

18:57.480 --> 18:58.540
have the final say.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.010
Alright,

19:00.400 --> 19:01.240
I'm leaving now.

19:01.240 --> 19:01.750
Just

19:02.160 --> 19:04.160
don't tell anyone I gave this to you.

19:04.510 --> 19:05.110
Thank you.

19:25.870 --> 19:27.070
Doctor,

19:27.640 --> 19:28.550
you need to

19:28.590 --> 19:30.000
examine me thoroughly

19:30.030 --> 19:30.890
for my illness,

19:32.360 --> 19:34.440
so those gossipers

19:34.790 --> 19:36.250
won't make snide remarks.

19:37.790 --> 19:39.640
I've married so many wives,

19:40.640 --> 19:42.960
but it's all for nothing.

19:44.480 --> 19:45.240
From now on,

19:45.310 --> 19:46.970
we'll take turns holding you.

19:47.310 --> 19:48.440
Even if you were made of stone,

19:48.440 --> 19:49.880
we'd warm you up.

19:52.790 --> 19:53.440
Fan me.

19:53.750 --> 19:54.270
Fan me.

19:54.400 --> 19:55.350
Good.

19:56.750 --> 19:57.400
Boss.

19:58.750 --> 19:59.720
You're here.

20:00.830 --> 20:02.580
You went to work for one day,

20:02.640 --> 20:05.200
and they've already stopped working?

20:06.000 --> 20:06.590
Indeed.

20:12.590 --> 20:14.030
Those 3 old fellows

20:14.680 --> 20:16.480
are too impatient.

20:17.920 --> 20:19.590
Thank you for the compliment, Boss.

20:19.590 --> 20:21.450
You think I'm complimenting you?

20:21.510 --> 20:23.370
Didn't you ask me to be a black sheep

20:23.370 --> 20:24.900
and stir things up in there?

20:25.570 --> 20:26.480
Not even a day has passed

20:26.480 --> 20:28.030
and I've nearly ruined everything.

20:28.030 --> 20:29.540
I think it won't take 30 days

20:29.540 --> 20:31.470
for me to get the pawnshop in order.

20:44.720 --> 20:45.830
Those 3 old guys

20:45.880 --> 20:47.540
really can't keep their cool.

20:48.510 --> 20:50.370
Although you're making excuses,

20:51.070 --> 20:53.360
there is some truth to what you say.

20:53.390 --> 20:54.790
Have they resigned then?

20:58.270 --> 21:00.590
I just need to nod, and it's done.

21:01.550 --> 21:04.010
But according to the rules
of this business,

21:04.200 --> 21:06.270
you can't just quit today

21:06.310 --> 21:07.810
and leave tomorrow.

21:08.160 --> 21:10.840
They need to find a replacement

21:11.310 --> 21:15.250
and get the business in order
for the boss

21:16.510 --> 21:18.070
before they can leave.

21:18.700 --> 21:20.030
How long will that take?

21:21.070 --> 21:24.360
At least 20 to 30 days.

21:26.170 --> 21:27.430
That should be enough.

21:27.960 --> 21:28.510
Boss.

21:28.800 --> 21:30.800
Please approve their resignation.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.610
My approval

21:34.880 --> 21:36.810
is just a matter of saying the word.

21:37.680 --> 21:39.770
But these 3 old appraisers

21:39.830 --> 21:41.800
are important figures

21:42.310 --> 21:43.880
with significant positions

21:43.880 --> 21:45.510
in the pawnshop business.

21:46.240 --> 21:47.610
If people find out

21:47.640 --> 21:48.960
that these 3

21:49.000 --> 21:50.000
are leaving soon,

21:50.110 --> 21:53.200
many will try to poach them.

21:55.000 --> 21:56.550
If they leave,

21:58.080 --> 21:59.740
will you keep an eye on things?

21:59.830 --> 22:00.830
Of course I can't.

22:01.940 --> 22:02.640
But none of them

22:02.640 --> 22:03.570
can truly leave.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.340
This isn't the time for you

22:06.350 --> 22:08.190
act smart.

22:08.550 --> 22:11.010
They're already on high alert.

22:11.440 --> 22:12.440
If you don't believe me,

22:12.440 --> 22:14.110
go to the pawnshop tomorrow
and see for yourself.

22:14.110 --> 22:14.830
No one there

22:14.880 --> 22:16.940
will dare tell you the truth anymore.

22:18.680 --> 22:20.580
After 30 days,

22:20.750 --> 22:22.760
I won't be able to keep them either.

22:23.070 --> 22:24.200
By then,

22:25.000 --> 22:26.350
because of this little trick

22:26.350 --> 22:27.540
you've played,

22:29.030 --> 22:31.030
we'll lose a significant business.

22:32.400 --> 22:33.270
Tell me,

22:35.480 --> 22:36.880
how should I punish you?

22:38.640 --> 22:39.770
I never exaggerate.

22:41.110 --> 22:42.640
We don't need 30 days at all.

23:01.340 --> 23:03.920
[Wanyuandang]

23:11.770 --> 23:14.320
[Wanyuandang]

23:14.350 --> 23:19.300
[Pawn goods]

23:21.720 --> 23:22.920
I want to pawn things.

23:25.680 --> 23:26.740
Where's your boss?

23:28.310 --> 23:30.730
We truly meet everywhere in life.

23:31.000 --> 23:33.350
So my father can't blame me for this now.

23:33.600 --> 23:34.930
What do you mean by that?

23:35.270 --> 23:36.160
Before I came here,

23:36.160 --> 23:37.640
my father was extremely worried.

23:37.640 --> 23:39.320
He repeatedly warned me

23:39.550 --> 23:41.070
to never speak with that

23:41.110 --> 23:42.640
exile from Ningguta.

23:43.300 --> 23:43.880
But today,

23:43.880 --> 23:44.980
you walked in by yourself,

23:44.980 --> 23:46.200
so you can't blame me.

23:47.160 --> 23:48.020
Where is Ms. Su?

23:49.160 --> 23:50.090
You've seen her?

23:51.830 --> 23:52.580
Do you know?

23:52.680 --> 23:54.360
The reputation of your Wanyuandang

23:54.360 --> 23:56.160
has spread throughout Pingyao.

23:56.440 --> 23:58.240
I heard about it when I entered the city.

23:58.240 --> 23:59.070
Everyone is waiting

23:59.070 --> 24:01.070
to see you make fools of yourselves.

24:01.120 --> 24:02.400
Let them wait.

24:02.750 --> 24:03.880
This business is so slow that even ghosts

24:03.880 --> 24:04.790
wouldn't survive it.

24:04.790 --> 24:06.050
I'm amazed you hung on.

24:06.310 --> 24:06.750
I heard

24:06.790 --> 24:08.480
you're recruiting good appraisers
and staff.

24:08.480 --> 24:09.110
Any luck?

24:09.770 --> 24:10.590
Ms. Su is handling

24:10.590 --> 24:11.620
these matters.

24:11.920 --> 24:13.430
I brought some people
from Beijing with me,

24:13.430 --> 24:15.090
all experienced appraisers.

24:15.110 --> 24:16.230
For the first couple of days,
they were willing

24:16.230 --> 24:17.200
to sit at their posts.

24:17.200 --> 24:17.880
Now,

24:18.030 --> 24:20.110
they're all hiding in the back room
playing cards and drinking,

24:20.110 --> 24:21.770
having a better time than I am.

24:25.560 --> 24:26.440
I heard

24:27.590 --> 24:28.850
you joined Taiyufeng.

24:28.920 --> 24:29.440
What?

24:30.320 --> 24:31.860
Are you here to spy on me,

24:32.150 --> 24:33.650
or were you kicked out?

24:34.400 --> 24:36.170
Of course I was kicked out.

24:37.270 --> 24:38.310
An amateur like me

24:38.350 --> 24:40.080
doesn't meet their standards.

24:40.310 --> 24:41.640
But I do have some ideas.

24:41.810 --> 24:42.350
Why don't we

24:42.350 --> 24:43.740
team up again this time?

24:44.030 --> 24:44.720
Team up?

24:45.210 --> 24:46.470
We are both amateurs.

24:46.790 --> 24:48.920
Haven't you heard of beginner's luck?

24:49.270 --> 24:49.900
Confucius said,

24:49.900 --> 24:52.900
Who's to say the new generation
can't surpass the old?

24:57.160 --> 24:58.160
Let's discuss it.

25:21.000 --> 25:21.680
Today,

25:22.000 --> 25:23.400
let's open for business.

25:25.550 --> 25:27.610
How long have we all worked together?

25:28.400 --> 25:29.460
More than 10 years.

25:30.400 --> 25:31.930
That makes us old partners.

25:32.790 --> 25:33.160
Yes.

25:34.440 --> 25:36.100
Yesterday we stopped working

25:36.550 --> 25:38.480
and asked the boss to let us resign.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.160
The boss

25:40.830 --> 25:41.750
agreed.

25:46.160 --> 25:47.880
The Four Major Banks of the capital

25:47.880 --> 25:49.270
and the Eight Families of Hedong

25:49.270 --> 25:51.030
have been trying to recruit us
for a long time.

25:51.030 --> 25:52.720
Since the boss has made up his mind,

25:52.720 --> 25:54.610
we ought to leave together.

25:54.920 --> 25:56.980
This is the head manager's blessing.

25:57.230 --> 25:58.720
Following the head manager is never wrong.

25:58.720 --> 26:00.440
-I knew it.
-Let’s work hard

26:00.480 --> 26:01.480
before the new recruits take over.

26:01.480 --> 26:03.390
We must not ruin
the head appraiser's reputation.

26:03.390 --> 26:04.720
Open up and do business.

26:08.670 --> 26:09.840
Where's that guy?

26:10.660 --> 26:11.660
Absent from work?

26:13.650 --> 26:15.270
You mean that bumbling amateur?

26:15.270 --> 26:17.160
He probably doesn't have
the face to show up.

26:17.160 --> 26:19.220
Sending such a fool to cause trouble,

26:19.510 --> 26:21.510
I wonder what the boss was thinking.

26:21.780 --> 26:28.680
[Wanyuandang City Gate Pawn Stall]

26:27.750 --> 26:28.210
Here.

26:32.720 --> 26:33.380
Put it here.

26:33.970 --> 26:35.750
♪ I've read the Four Books
and Five Classics ♪

26:35.770 --> 26:37.440
♪ I've learned to be magnanimous ♪

26:37.470 --> 26:40.020
♪ And forget the past grudges ♪

26:39.880 --> 26:40.480
Everyone.

26:40.070 --> 26:42.070
♪ I've traveled through the years ♪

26:42.100 --> 26:43.700
♪ As life roughens my face ♪

26:42.750 --> 26:43.590
Silver.

26:43.740 --> 26:46.370
♪ I've felt the coldness between people ♪

26:45.070 --> 26:46.180
So much silver!

26:46.390 --> 26:49.500
♪ I've seen the vast snow ♪

26:49.570 --> 26:52.530
♪ I was once held tightly by someone ♪

26:52.600 --> 26:53.700
♪ The meaning of survival ♪

26:53.780 --> 26:55.670
♪ Is all about staying fed ♪

26:53.810 --> 26:54.600
Ladies and gentlemen,

26:54.600 --> 26:56.590
young and old from Pingyao,

26:55.720 --> 26:57.170
♪ Turn around ♪

26:56.650 --> 26:58.640
and brothers from the surrounding areas,

26:57.200 --> 26:58.760
♪ And try to be brave ♪

26:58.820 --> 27:04.220
♪ The show is about to start ♪

26:59.350 --> 27:00.670
I am Li Qin,

27:01.030 --> 27:02.890
from the Li family in the capital.

27:04.400 --> 27:05.720
Here in Pingyao,

27:05.740 --> 27:07.720
I've opened the Wanyuandang pawnshop.

27:07.720 --> 27:08.850
It's mainly for me

27:08.880 --> 27:10.350
to learn from the trade as a student.

27:10.350 --> 27:12.080
Thank you all for your support.

27:12.310 --> 27:13.880
Nice!

27:14.400 --> 27:16.020
We're amateurs.

27:16.310 --> 27:17.440
We don't dare to trouble

27:17.440 --> 27:18.920
everyone to walk all the way

27:18.920 --> 27:20.460
to our shop for business.

27:21.000 --> 27:21.810
We wouldn't dare

27:21.810 --> 27:23.480
to stand behind that high counter

27:23.480 --> 27:25.200
and look down on people, either.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.640
We'll just do business

27:26.710 --> 27:28.180
here by the city gate.

27:28.570 --> 27:29.430
Goods for cash,

27:29.680 --> 27:30.920
on the spot.

27:31.310 --> 27:33.720
Wanyuandang's pawnshop
is on the east side,

27:33.720 --> 27:35.460
and our bank is on the west side.

27:36.030 --> 27:38.600
Claim silver with your receipts.
Fair to young and old alike.

27:38.600 --> 27:39.640
Ladies and gentlemen,

27:39.640 --> 27:40.480
please go ahead.

27:40.480 --> 27:41.020
Great!

27:41.310 --> 27:42.190
Let's go.

27:42.240 --> 27:43.240
Come on.

27:42.490 --> 27:44.310
♪ No matter how many tears you shed ♪

27:44.270 --> 27:44.680
Madam,

27:44.380 --> 27:45.890
♪ As long as you can get up ♪

27:44.720 --> 27:45.830
what would you like to pawn?

27:45.830 --> 27:46.830
Claim silver with your receipts.

27:45.960 --> 27:48.540
♪ You can brush it off as a joke ♪

27:47.210 --> 27:47.720
This hairpin.

27:47.720 --> 27:48.620
Fair to young and old alike.

27:48.620 --> 27:50.500
♪ If I can still breathe ♪

27:50.590 --> 27:52.090
♪ I can hold up this weight ♪

27:52.180 --> 27:54.850
♪ And brave the blade and storm ♪

27:54.930 --> 27:57.950
♪ Life is unpredictable anyway ♪

27:56.790 --> 27:57.920
It weighs 3 taels and 3 maces.

27:57.920 --> 27:59.000
Round off the 3 maces.

27:57.970 --> 28:01.000
♪ I clench my teeth and keep going ♪

27:59.820 --> 28:00.950
One silver hairpin,

28:01.060 --> 28:02.160
♪ Let them say ♪

28:01.540 --> 28:02.510
pawned for 3 taels of silver.

28:02.230 --> 28:04.180
♪ That I can't make it all they want ♪

28:02.590 --> 28:03.270
-Three taels of silver?
-Three taels!

28:03.270 --> 28:04.230
Write the receipt.

28:04.230 --> 28:05.680
♪ Turn around ♪

28:04.350 --> 28:05.320
Really?

28:05.590 --> 28:06.200
Ma'am,

28:05.740 --> 28:07.240
♪ And try to be brave ♪

28:06.590 --> 28:07.350
the 3 maces

28:07.320 --> 28:12.790
♪ The show is about to start ♪

28:07.400 --> 28:09.240
will be considered our small profit.

28:09.240 --> 28:10.160
Are you satisfied?

28:10.160 --> 28:11.360
Yes, very satisfied.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.110
Come,

28:12.860 --> 28:15.240
♪ The world is full of reasons ♪

28:12.960 --> 28:14.160
sign these receipts.

28:14.530 --> 28:16.230
[Wanyuandang]
[1 silver hairpin for 3 tales]

28:15.270 --> 28:16.550
♪ And tales of loyalty ♪

28:16.600 --> 28:19.610
♪ We should be just and compassionate ♪

28:17.570 --> 28:20.690
[Wanyuandang]
[1 silver hairpin for 3 tales]

28:19.690 --> 28:21.270
♪ Among the smoke
there is just one path ♪

28:21.380 --> 28:24.770
♪ I'll measure this life step by step ♪

28:26.070 --> 28:27.030
One at a time, please.

28:27.030 --> 28:27.590
Everyone,

28:27.230 --> 28:28.240
♪ The sun will always rise ♪

28:27.750 --> 28:28.410
don't rush.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.480
Yes, we have them.

28:30.480 --> 28:31.720
We have them right here.

28:31.720 --> 28:32.750
Don't rush.

28:36.080 --> 28:36.880
Don't push.

28:37.270 --> 28:37.890
Here.

28:38.310 --> 28:39.770
Find this hairpin for her.

28:41.590 --> 28:42.310
Don't rush.

28:42.330 --> 28:43.720
-Come on. Next.
-Slow down.

28:43.720 --> 28:44.910
Don't rush,

28:44.960 --> 28:46.390
one at a time.

28:46.480 --> 28:47.680
We have them all here.

28:47.750 --> 28:48.640
Yes, we do.

28:49.160 --> 28:49.720
Come on.

28:49.740 --> 28:50.240
Look at

28:50.480 --> 28:51.540
what they've done.

28:51.590 --> 28:53.000
They've emptied out our storerooms.

28:53.000 --> 28:54.200
That bumbling amateur

28:54.200 --> 28:55.760
and that young master Li

28:55.830 --> 28:57.110
from the capital

28:57.310 --> 28:59.880
are spending money like crazy
at the city gate.

28:59.880 --> 29:01.590
He pawned a silver hairpin
worth 3 taels and 3 maces

29:01.590 --> 29:03.190
for 3 taels!

29:03.600 --> 29:05.440
Is there such a business anywhere else?

29:05.440 --> 29:06.620
It's laughable!

29:07.750 --> 29:09.510
They didn't even invite
an appraiser?

29:09.510 --> 29:10.370
No.

29:10.740 --> 29:11.900
Don't worry, sir.

29:12.530 --> 29:14.310
A man from the capital

29:14.440 --> 29:16.400
dares to open a pawnshop in Pingyao.

29:16.400 --> 29:17.050
He's showing off

29:17.050 --> 29:18.750
in front of the real experts,

29:18.830 --> 29:20.720
basically asking for failure.

29:22.070 --> 29:23.430
The head manager from the bank is here

29:23.430 --> 29:24.890
to see the head appraiser.

29:31.960 --> 29:32.960
Appraiser Zhu,

29:33.000 --> 29:34.650
what are you up to?

29:39.440 --> 29:41.280
What are you talking about?

29:43.160 --> 29:44.270
That guy at the city gate

29:44.270 --> 29:45.200
has now extended his reach

29:45.200 --> 29:46.200
into our banks,

29:46.640 --> 29:48.500
and you're still staying silent?

29:48.580 --> 29:51.060
What does this have to do with us?

29:52.330 --> 29:53.530
Funny you'd say that.

29:53.560 --> 29:54.980
You're really something,

29:54.980 --> 29:55.820
sending your little devil out there

29:55.820 --> 29:57.770
while you enjoy your peace and quiet here.

29:57.770 --> 29:59.040
That guy from the capital

29:59.040 --> 29:59.830
has raised the interest rates

29:59.830 --> 30:00.740
at his own bank.

30:00.880 --> 30:01.880
Now, everyone in Pingyao

30:01.880 --> 30:02.880
who has any money

30:02.980 --> 30:03.790
has withdrawn their silver

30:03.790 --> 30:05.320
and deposited it with them.

30:05.890 --> 30:07.830
[Taiyufeng draft bank Manager Wang]

30:06.030 --> 30:06.720
Appraiser Zhu,

30:06.720 --> 30:08.250
please give us some advice!

30:08.480 --> 30:11.010
People are already withdrawing
from my bank.

30:12.440 --> 30:14.880
My shop has plenty of silver.

30:16.010 --> 30:17.990
Let them withdraw all they want.

30:19.030 --> 30:21.240
The business cannot fail.

30:24.350 --> 30:25.410
Someone come here.

30:26.640 --> 30:27.170
Yes, sir.

30:28.400 --> 30:29.240
Tell the staff

30:29.270 --> 30:30.730
to prepare all the silver.

30:31.070 --> 30:32.400
Make a trip every 2 hours

30:32.590 --> 30:34.400
to deliver them to our own bank.

30:35.230 --> 30:36.270
Get going right now.

30:36.270 --> 30:36.960
Okay.

30:42.440 --> 30:43.000
Appraiser Zhu,

30:43.000 --> 30:43.330
what if

30:43.330 --> 30:44.790
it's not enough?

30:45.550 --> 30:46.480
Those two bumbling amateurs

30:46.480 --> 30:47.510
have really stirred up

30:47.510 --> 30:48.310
a hornet's nest in Pingyao.

30:48.310 --> 30:48.800
Well...

30:49.070 --> 30:50.350
All other banks are
in the same situation as we are.

30:50.350 --> 30:51.270
Everyone is withdrawing their money

30:51.270 --> 30:52.450
and depositing it into their bank.

30:52.450 --> 30:53.510
If we're not careful

30:53.510 --> 30:54.570
and one bank fails,

30:54.790 --> 30:56.440
we'll become a laughingstock.

30:56.440 --> 30:57.030
We can't let amateurs

30:57.030 --> 30:58.630
destroy the professionals.

31:00.450 --> 31:02.380
If they think they can outspend us,

31:02.830 --> 31:04.630
they've come to the wrong place.

31:08.830 --> 31:09.880
Don't worry.

31:10.390 --> 31:11.790
If you run short of funds,

31:12.680 --> 31:14.210
I'll transfer some for you.

31:20.720 --> 31:21.490
Boss.

31:21.830 --> 31:22.510
The stuff people

31:22.510 --> 31:23.670
redeemed from us

31:23.830 --> 31:25.160
all ended up in the hands

31:25.160 --> 31:26.950
of that bumbling amateur duo.

31:27.130 --> 31:28.640
Isn't it funny?

31:37.600 --> 31:39.100
Don't rush. One at a time.

31:41.070 --> 31:42.170
Weigh it for me.

31:44.440 --> 31:46.270
This is how much we earned today.

31:46.660 --> 31:47.240
Deposit it.

31:47.240 --> 31:47.550
Yes, sir!

31:47.550 --> 31:48.680
One pearl hairpin,

31:49.050 --> 31:50.400
pawned for 5 taels of silver.

31:50.400 --> 31:51.790
Your vase transaction is complete.

31:51.790 --> 31:52.590
Sign here.

31:52.700 --> 31:55.310
[May 3, the 11th year of Xianfeng]
[9 maces and 3 candareen]

31:52.790 --> 31:54.920
Nine maces and 3 candareens of silver.

31:55.000 --> 31:55.550
Just make

31:56.070 --> 31:57.070
an X mark here.

31:57.120 --> 31:58.590
I want to pawn something!

31:58.910 --> 32:00.290
One bundle of fine cloth,

32:00.290 --> 32:01.310
pawned for 10 taels of silver.

32:01.310 --> 32:02.550
It's redeemable anytime.

32:02.550 --> 32:04.020
See that large silver gourd

32:04.020 --> 32:04.920
at the entrance of my shop?

32:04.920 --> 32:06.200
If I can't pay you back,

32:06.270 --> 32:07.510
you can take an axe

32:07.540 --> 32:08.680
and chop down that silver gourd

32:08.680 --> 32:09.270
tomorrow and carry it away.

32:09.270 --> 32:10.270
I won't say a word.

32:24.160 --> 32:25.030
Nobody's here.

32:27.080 --> 32:28.150
They've been causing a scene

32:28.150 --> 32:29.480
at the city gate all day.

32:29.720 --> 32:30.780
If this continues,

32:31.110 --> 32:32.240
the magistrate will send troops

32:32.240 --> 32:33.240
to drive them out.

32:33.350 --> 32:35.350
They can't even close the city gate.

32:36.550 --> 32:37.830
I just don't understand.

32:37.830 --> 32:39.480
Is Gu Pingyuan working

32:39.510 --> 32:40.630
for Taiyufeng or not?

32:40.630 --> 32:42.430
Why is he helping outsiders now?

32:45.930 --> 32:47.860
He wanted to join Taiyufeng,

32:48.790 --> 32:50.680
but Taiyufeng rejected him.

32:51.590 --> 32:52.650
It doesn't matter.

32:53.350 --> 32:54.670
I want to see

32:54.960 --> 32:58.070
what these two can accomplish.

33:31.250 --> 33:32.790
The items redeemed today

33:33.000 --> 33:34.590
exceed those of several years.

33:34.590 --> 33:35.890
Congratulations to you.

33:35.890 --> 33:37.750
That bumbling amateur accidentally

33:37.750 --> 33:39.000
ended up helping us.

33:50.270 --> 33:51.410
He's not an amateur,

33:52.510 --> 33:53.970
but an increasing threat.

34:00.480 --> 34:01.880
Be careful with that jar.

34:02.930 --> 34:03.860
Carry it inside.

34:04.200 --> 34:05.130
Watch the floor.

34:09.800 --> 34:10.330
Alright.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.230
Oh great,

34:20.739 --> 34:21.920
I have gathered all the junk

34:21.920 --> 34:22.690
in Pingyao.

34:23.030 --> 34:24.159
Excuse me, Manager.

34:25.110 --> 34:27.040
Why do I feel it's still not enough?

34:29.960 --> 34:31.270
We've outdone ourselves

34:31.270 --> 34:32.000
as amateurs.

34:32.360 --> 34:33.460
Someone literally just

34:33.460 --> 34:34.130
walked out

34:34.230 --> 34:34.960
after pawning his stuff here

34:34.960 --> 34:36.489
and started laughing at us.

34:36.760 --> 34:38.550
We're basically burning our cash

34:38.550 --> 34:39.400
to buy publicity.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.570
If you can't take the risk,

34:40.570 --> 34:41.500
then don't do it.

34:41.929 --> 34:42.510
There's no risk

34:42.510 --> 34:43.969
in the world I cannot take.

34:44.150 --> 34:45.610
Let's continue tomorrow.

34:46.510 --> 34:48.150
Today was busy because of the market.

34:48.150 --> 34:49.440
I'm afraid there won't be

34:49.440 --> 34:50.840
as many people tomorrow.

34:51.110 --> 34:51.960
Tomorrow,

34:52.550 --> 34:54.010
we'll adjust our tactics.

34:54.590 --> 34:55.770
We'll sweep through

34:55.800 --> 34:56.900
all 9 townships and 12 villages,

34:56.900 --> 34:59.030
and visit every household in Pingyao.

34:59.960 --> 35:01.050
This is called...

35:02.670 --> 35:03.550
It's called...

35:04.800 --> 35:06.360
Door-to-door pawning.

35:06.980 --> 35:07.590
Gu.

35:08.190 --> 35:09.250
That's a good name.

35:09.630 --> 35:10.540
Door-to-door pawning it is.

35:10.540 --> 35:14.350
[Li Mansion]

35:14.840 --> 35:17.170
All the world's goods have come to Shanxi.

35:19.000 --> 35:19.800
And in Shanxi,

35:19.800 --> 35:21.800
they've gathered in one city.

35:22.710 --> 35:25.030
They used to belong to different masters,

35:25.030 --> 35:27.160
but now they're united under one roof.

35:28.030 --> 35:28.510
How can there be

35:28.510 --> 35:30.370
such a coincidence in this world?

35:32.430 --> 35:34.000
It's quite fitting for that Mr. Gu

35:34.000 --> 35:35.170
and Young Master

35:35.800 --> 35:36.920
to unite as a team.

35:38.320 --> 35:39.000
How so?

35:39.450 --> 35:41.860
In our line of work,
we call people like these two

35:41.860 --> 35:42.990
bumbling amateurs.

35:43.710 --> 35:44.710
It's amazing how many

35:44.710 --> 35:46.570
weird ideas they can come up with.

35:46.700 --> 35:47.630
They've left the people of Shanxi

35:47.630 --> 35:49.030
completely bewildered.

35:51.100 --> 35:52.860
When they turn on each other,

35:53.320 --> 35:54.590
he won't be so happy.

35:55.520 --> 35:56.440
This child...

35:57.880 --> 35:59.000
Such a headache.

35:59.460 --> 36:01.540
[Taiping]

36:05.480 --> 36:07.740
The pawnshop business isn't doing well.

36:09.190 --> 36:11.530
When I left, the young master said that

36:12.120 --> 36:13.150
the locals don't trust

36:13.150 --> 36:14.510
that they'll stay in business long,

36:14.510 --> 36:15.060
so they refuse

36:15.060 --> 36:16.520
to pawn their items there.

36:17.320 --> 36:19.480
But it's nothing short of a miracle that

36:19.480 --> 36:21.480
he got the draft bank up and running.

36:23.360 --> 36:25.960
Draft banks offer loans,
and pawnshops release funds.

36:25.960 --> 36:27.230
The loans and funds

36:27.280 --> 36:28.800
must be balanced to the candareen.

36:28.800 --> 36:29.540
This kind of

36:29.560 --> 36:30.960
short-sighted approach

36:30.960 --> 36:32.620
just shows his inexperience.

36:34.280 --> 36:35.540
The young master asked

36:36.110 --> 36:37.810
if the family could find a way

36:38.110 --> 36:39.970
to support him for a while longer.

36:40.070 --> 36:40.630
So I

36:41.280 --> 36:43.810
promised to come back
and speak on his behalf.

36:45.960 --> 36:47.620
He's only been gone a few days,

36:47.920 --> 36:50.070
and already wants the main branch
to send money?

36:50.070 --> 36:51.730
Ask him if he can manage or not.

36:51.840 --> 36:52.840
If not, come back.

36:53.360 --> 36:55.360
I'll find someone else to take over.

36:56.150 --> 36:56.920
How much can you offer?

36:56.920 --> 36:57.520
Two taels.

36:57.670 --> 36:59.070
-Look.
-We are the door-to-door pawning service.

36:59.070 --> 37:00.230
It's our new service,
door-to-door pawning.

37:00.230 --> 37:01.630
What kind of scam is this?

37:01.920 --> 37:03.800
Not a scam, it's door-to-door pawning.

37:03.800 --> 37:04.630
No thanks.

37:17.710 --> 37:18.360
Coming!

37:19.510 --> 37:20.070
Who are you?

37:20.070 --> 37:20.840
Hello, ma'am.

37:20.840 --> 37:22.670
I'm the manager

37:22.710 --> 37:24.150
of Pingyao's Wanyuandang.

37:24.150 --> 37:25.510
We've just launched

37:25.530 --> 37:27.150
a new service called door-to-door pawning.

37:27.150 --> 37:28.230
If you have anything

37:28.230 --> 37:29.270
you need to pawn,

37:29.320 --> 37:30.920
you don't need to travel far.

37:30.960 --> 37:32.110
Just go to the village entrance

37:32.110 --> 37:34.220
and find Mr. Gu.

37:34.400 --> 37:35.320
The silver and pawn tickets

37:35.320 --> 37:36.620
are already prepared for you.

37:36.620 --> 37:39.870
[Templeside Pawnshop]

37:38.440 --> 37:39.280
This is

37:39.760 --> 37:41.230
a "Diamond Sutra" written in blood

37:41.230 --> 37:42.710
by our master in the Tang Dynasty.

37:42.710 --> 37:44.770
I wish to pawn it for 50 taels of silver

37:45.230 --> 37:46.900
[Upright and honorable]

37:45.230 --> 37:46.960
to rebuild the meditation hall

37:46.990 --> 37:48.490
[Templeside Pawnshop]

37:47.400 --> 37:48.930
that burned down last year.

37:53.960 --> 37:54.560
Record.

37:54.880 --> 37:55.400
Record!

37:55.550 --> 37:57.880
One Tang Dynasty "Diamond Sutra"
written in blood

37:57.880 --> 37:59.140
for 50 taels of silver,

37:59.280 --> 38:00.500
payable upon presentation of receipt.

38:00.500 --> 38:01.320
Venerable Abbot,

38:01.320 --> 38:02.320
please sign here.

38:03.880 --> 38:04.610
Benefactor,

38:05.280 --> 38:06.360
aren't you going to check it?

38:06.360 --> 38:07.190
It's such a sacred object.

38:07.190 --> 38:08.550
Casually flipping it open

38:08.550 --> 38:09.900
would be sacrilege.

38:10.690 --> 38:12.310
[Wanyuandang Templeside Pawnshop]

38:11.030 --> 38:12.390
Before the Buddha,

38:12.920 --> 38:14.250
I dare not be deceitful.

38:14.590 --> 38:15.920
Master, have no doubts.

38:15.920 --> 38:17.120
Just take the silver.

38:18.190 --> 38:19.630
It's not even

38:19.670 --> 38:20.760
tax season yet.

38:20.800 --> 38:21.490
Besides,

38:21.760 --> 38:22.550
we have money at home.

38:22.550 --> 38:23.550
We don't need to sell anything.

38:23.550 --> 38:23.920
Yes.

38:24.000 --> 38:25.480
If you're not spending that money

38:25.480 --> 38:26.400
and you have items to pawn,

38:26.400 --> 38:27.590
after pawning them, you can immediately

38:27.590 --> 38:28.710
deposit the money in our bank.

38:28.710 --> 38:30.400
Our bank offers 3% interest.

38:30.510 --> 38:32.510
It's 1.5% higher
than everywhere else in Pingyao.

38:32.510 --> 38:33.980
And the more you deposit,

38:34.070 --> 38:35.550
the higher your profit will be.

38:35.550 --> 38:36.550
Fair to young and old alike.

38:36.550 --> 38:38.000
I think you won't be able

38:38.070 --> 38:38.840
to spend all this silver at once

38:38.840 --> 38:40.110
on renovating the temple.

38:40.110 --> 38:41.240
Why not hire workers

38:41.590 --> 38:42.590
and deposit this money

38:42.590 --> 38:44.580
in Wanyuandang's bank first?

38:44.960 --> 38:46.960
The costs for materials and workers

38:47.000 --> 38:48.530
can be withdrawn as needed.

38:49.030 --> 38:50.230
The interest generated

38:50.230 --> 38:51.230
can be considered

38:51.280 --> 38:52.740
our donation to the temple.

38:52.690 --> 38:54.350
[Daxiong Hall]

38:55.630 --> 38:56.530
Very well.

38:56.880 --> 38:57.890
Let's do that.

38:58.990 --> 39:05.700
[Taiyufeng]

39:11.400 --> 39:11.960
Boss.

39:12.630 --> 39:13.490
Welcome, Boss.

39:14.800 --> 39:15.800
Good day, Boss.

39:25.030 --> 39:26.630
Please, everyone, sit down.

39:28.880 --> 39:30.230
Why did you

39:31.030 --> 39:32.110
ask me here today?

39:34.030 --> 39:35.150
Are you planning

39:35.440 --> 39:37.280
to resign again

39:37.320 --> 39:38.590
and leave right away?

39:38.670 --> 39:39.380
Boss,

39:39.550 --> 39:41.050
please stop teasing us.

39:41.630 --> 39:43.230
That matter about us leaving

39:43.320 --> 39:44.000
is over.

39:44.080 --> 39:44.880
That's right.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.250
That matter is finished.

39:46.250 --> 39:47.400
Gone with the wind.

39:47.670 --> 39:48.010
Yes.

39:48.760 --> 39:49.510
Today,

39:49.920 --> 39:51.500
we invited you here

39:52.030 --> 39:53.230
because we want to ask

39:53.510 --> 39:54.920
about that young man.

39:55.670 --> 39:57.090
We don't know

39:57.250 --> 39:59.590
what dealings you have with him.

40:00.190 --> 40:02.500
But his actions

40:03.070 --> 40:05.530
have caused public outrage in Pingyao.

40:05.950 --> 40:07.030
We have to

40:07.070 --> 40:08.920
inform you about this.

40:08.950 --> 40:09.680
That amateur

40:10.320 --> 40:11.720
has broken all the rules.

40:12.510 --> 40:13.480
In these past 10 days or so,

40:13.480 --> 40:15.030
he's been through every corner of Pingyao,

40:15.030 --> 40:16.000
taking everything he can get.

40:16.000 --> 40:17.910
All the pawnshops are empty,

40:18.070 --> 40:19.760
everything's been bought up
by his business.

40:19.760 --> 40:20.920
Items worth 3 taels

40:21.030 --> 40:21.860
he pawns for 5.

40:22.030 --> 40:24.160
Things worth 5 taels, he gives 10!

40:24.280 --> 40:26.120
He comes with a bank

40:26.590 --> 40:28.230
offering high interest rates.

40:28.230 --> 40:31.050
He's been causing trouble

40:31.280 --> 40:32.840
for every bank in Pingyao.

40:33.150 --> 40:34.710
Everyone's withdrawing their money

40:34.710 --> 40:36.510
and depositing it with his bank.

40:36.930 --> 40:38.590
It's gotten to the point where

40:39.000 --> 40:41.300
both our pawnshops

40:41.360 --> 40:43.270
banks are empty.

40:44.030 --> 40:44.530
In this world,

40:44.530 --> 40:46.260
nobody does business this way.

40:46.440 --> 40:48.450
He's truly a black sheep.

40:49.030 --> 40:50.630
You're familiar with
the county magistrate.

40:50.630 --> 40:52.110
Please step in and do something about him.

40:52.110 --> 40:53.550
If this chaos continues,

40:54.190 --> 40:56.280
things will really get out of hand.

41:01.030 --> 41:02.290
The pawnshop's profit

41:02.320 --> 41:03.850
comes mainly from interest

41:04.150 --> 41:05.490
and undervaluing collateral.

41:05.490 --> 41:06.590
Conditional pawning

41:06.590 --> 41:07.630
sucks people dry.

41:08.230 --> 41:09.560
While outright pawning

41:10.070 --> 41:12.000
squeezes the last worth out of them.

41:12.000 --> 41:13.280
And yet you've somehow managed to ruin

41:13.280 --> 41:15.410
this extremely profitable business.

41:15.710 --> 41:17.910
They offer discounts and still profit,

41:18.360 --> 41:19.620
but what about you lot?

41:19.920 --> 41:23.110
You only know how to make me
call the magistrate to arrest people.

41:23.110 --> 41:24.500
This isn't how you do business.

41:24.500 --> 41:26.550
You're just waiting for your own deaths.

41:26.550 --> 41:27.110
Boss.

41:27.360 --> 41:27.960
Boss.

41:28.320 --> 41:30.070
You shouldn't be so harsh

41:30.110 --> 41:30.840
on us.

41:31.000 --> 41:32.220
If we fail now,

41:32.250 --> 41:33.030
we won't be able

41:33.030 --> 41:35.090
to survive in this business anymore.

41:35.110 --> 41:36.770
If you keep talking like this,

41:37.040 --> 41:37.700
then you're

41:37.760 --> 41:39.760
not honoring all we've done for you.

41:40.410 --> 41:41.250
Please, Boss,

41:41.430 --> 41:42.710
think of all we've done for you.

41:42.710 --> 41:43.110
Boss,

41:43.150 --> 41:45.280
please think of all we've done for you.

41:50.030 --> 41:51.610
All you've done for me...

41:56.400 --> 41:57.360
General Bao is here

41:57.360 --> 41:59.630
to redeem his blade
and Imperial Yellow Jacket.

41:59.630 --> 42:00.090
This...

42:01.360 --> 42:01.890
Go get it.

42:03.070 --> 42:05.320
Gu Pingyuan handled this pawn, right?

42:08.880 --> 42:09.810
General Bao says

42:10.110 --> 42:11.440
he won't take his things

42:11.480 --> 42:13.210
unless he sees Mr. Gu in person.

42:13.210 --> 42:13.630
You go.

42:14.700 --> 42:15.150
Shoo.

42:37.710 --> 42:39.570
We've been hunters all our lives,

42:40.070 --> 42:42.580
but now we're the hunted.

42:45.030 --> 42:45.880
You all better

42:45.920 --> 42:47.360
behave yourselves!

42:55.070 --> 42:55.630
Boss.

42:56.150 --> 42:57.250
He has now

42:57.880 --> 43:00.770
gone to Wanyuandang to find Gu Pingyuan.

43:01.400 --> 43:02.680
Do you know who he is?
